    "title": "Merge Nodes Between Zeros",
    "category": "Linked List",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "problemStatement": "You are given a linked list whose first and last nodes contain the value 0. Between every pair of consecutive zero-valued nodes, replace all nodes with a single node whose value is the sum of the values between those zeros. Return the modified linked list.",
    "input": "Integer n Linked list",
    "output": "The transformed linked list.",
    "constraints": "3 <= n <= 2 \u00d7 10^5 The first and last node values are 0."
